/* =====================================================================
   ALPHA AGENT SYSTEM — V2 (real data)
   Niche availability + pricing data sourced from Jiangnan Villa's own
   floor plan PDFs and price list PDFs. Cash-rebate promotion sourced
   from the 01.07.2026–30.09.2026 Customer Promotion memo.
   AVAIL_RAW below is rebuilt from the company's "Niche Floor Plan"
   export (NICHE_STATUS_UPDATED) -- a native Excel->PDF export, not a
   scan, so both text AND cell fill color were read programmatically
   (yellow = sold, white/none = available, same convention as the
   burial floor plan). This replaces an older, less complete list.
   Coverage gaps (kept honest, not invented):
   - Block F ground floor (F1,F2,F3) niches have no price list on file,
     so they'll show as available in search but "no price found" in
     the calculator
   - Block M has 0 available niches (fully sold)
   - A handful of cells (Block K hall 1, Block L) are shaded a separate
     category color that isn't sold/available -- excluded from AVAIL_RAW
     rather than guessed
   This is a dated snapshot, not a live feed -- niches sell daily.
===================================================================== */

